{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方珊瑚红色的大字「不再藏着喜欢」，随后被下方同样醒目的黄色大字「连害臊都顾不上了」吸引。右上角目录和下方音符动画不是主要视觉入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人不再隐藏自己的喜欢，甚至顾不上害臊了；具体发生了什么还不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"大胆、急切，有强烈情绪推动的意味；具体是兴奋、感动还是难过，不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"期待似乎终于得到满足但事情还没有结束；从梦境回到现实的落差，以及想流泪、胸口发痛的复杂感受。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里：大字表达不再隐藏喜欢和顾不上害臊，下方段落才交代期待得到满足后的复杂感受，需要拼接才能理解完整情绪。\",\n    \"单块较长：下方文字包含梦境与现实、期待兑现、夕阳意象、想流泪和胸口发痛等多层意思。\",\n    \"放大的词本身说不清具体处境和深层感受，主要传达的是态度。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a659a7da-f969-470e-a9b8-b9c82b10d014", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T020910272221Z", "elapsed_seconds": 24.813, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:09:35.083611+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e251895330ff824ec7ed3afdc885185df208d9818ecb67e883e688e463d15335", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa